<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Oct yr-on-yr industrial index up 12.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Oct yr-on-yr industrial index up 12.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's industrial production index rose 12.0 percent in October compared to October 1995, the national Bernama news agency reported on Friday.</p>
<p>On a month-on-month basis, the index was up 1.8 percent from September, the agency quoted the Statistics Department as saying.  </p>
<p>The Department said for the first 10 months of the year, the index was at 231.0, up 10.7 percent against 208.6 for the corresponding period last year.</p>
<p>INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION INDEX</p>
<p> October 1996   - 244.10</p>
<p> October 1995   - 218.0</p>
<p> September 1996 - 239.7</p>
</text>
